<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>some.pics (中文)</title><link>https://some.pics</link><description>只是网上的一些图片。</description><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Sat, 08 Aug 2026 12:16:51 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>探索拉本</title><link>https://some.pics/6a771e2f71040</link><description>&lt;p&gt;🏃🏻 去探索拉本纳。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="🏃🏻 Labenne gaan verkennen. " height="1486" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/atog/6a771e2f71040.jpg" width="1179"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://atog.some.pics"&gt;@atog&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 08 Aug 2026 12:16:51 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title/><link>https://some.pics/6a770deed166a</link><description>&lt;p&gt;等待晚餐&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Waiting for dinner" height="2160" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/sergio/6a770deed166a.jpg" width="3840"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://sergio.some.pics"&gt;@sergio&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 08 Aug 2026 11:07:30 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title/><link>https://some.pics/6a76f85361492</link><description>&lt;p&gt;这是一幅来自《比利和曼迪的冒险》中死神（Grim）的素描。这个月以来，我每天早晨都会画点什么，我想继续保持这个习惯。

整个八月，我都在速写各种随机挑选的卡通人物。它们很容易找到参考图，而且画起来既有趣又相对简单。我想让重新养成每日绘画习惯这件事变得尽可能轻松。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A stylized drawing of Grim from The Grim Adventures of Billy &amp;amp; Mandy, wearing his black hooded robe with red lining and holding a large gray scythe. He stands against a textured gray background with a slightly worried expression." height="1903" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/dhester/6a76f85361492.jpg" width="1903"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://dhester.some.pics"&gt;@dhester&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 08 Aug 2026 09:35:18 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title/><link>https://some.pics/6a76f6a2891d8</link><description>&lt;p&gt;又是幽灵。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="An empty Fritz Cola bottle on an old windowsill. The inner side of the label is white and has a black ghost on it. The ghost is grinning wide and has two middle fingers up." height="2000" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/z428/6a76f6a2891d8.jpg" width="1125"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://z428.some.pics"&gt;@z428&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 08 Aug 2026 09:28:04 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>新泽西远眺纽约</title><link>https://some.pics/6a76e99e84825</link><description>&lt;p&gt;从新泽西看纽约（2012）&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="New York from New Jersey  (2012)" height="717" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/hiddenflair/6a76e99e84825.jpg" width="960"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://hiddenflair.some.pics"&gt;@hiddenflair&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 08 Aug 2026 08:32:32 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>